Total history CSV rounds valued amounts without display separators.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight total-history --accounts 'Assets:Cash' --format csv

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  2.005 SEK
  Equity:Opening
2024-01-02 Increase
  Assets:Cash  9997.995 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

date,amount
2024-01-01,2.01
2024-01-02,10000.00

========== WARNINGS ==========
